## 8. Known limits and open questions

- The schema base URI `https://project-air.dev/contracts/0.1.0/` is a stable namespace, not a
  hosted or fetched document; the final project domain is still an owner decision.
- The fractional-index pattern accepts 1-64 alphanumeric characters; the exact alphabet/algorithm
  (for example base-62 lexicographic ranks) is a codegen concern of P1-03 and may tighten it.
- The note body shape (structured editor document) is deliberately not in 0.1.0; it arrives with
  the editor stage. Images, files, comments, templates and workspace members are later contract
  growth from blueprint 5.1.
- Block content (checklist items, palette swatches, columns/timeline/table rows) is not modelled yet;
  this contract covers identity, geometry, type and minimum sizes only.
- The workspace package version stays 0.0.0 like the other workspace packages; the contract version
  0.1.0 lives in the schema $ids, the root contractVersion const and index.mjs.
